# Background worker

## Files

- `background/service-worker.js` — message router, AI generation, license, PDF trigger, queue
- `background/queue-processor.js` — bulk URL queue (opens tabs, scrape, generate)
- `offscreen/offscreen.html` + `pdf-generator.js` — jsPDF from local `jspdf.umd.min.js`

## Message types (popup/content → background)

`JOB_DETECTED`, `GENERATE_APPLICATION`, `FILL_FORM`, `GENERATE_PDF`, `VALIDATE_LICENSE`, `GET_APPLICATION_COUNT`, `PROCESS_QUEUE`, `TEST_API_KEY`, `APPLICATION_SUBMITTED`

Return `{ error: string }` on failure. Use `return true` + `sendResponse` for async handlers.

## PDF / offscreen

- Check `chrome.offscreen.hasDocument()` before `createDocument`
- `GENERATE_PDF_OFFSCREEN` must **not** be handled in service worker (`return false` so offscreen receives it)
- Reasons: `DOM_SCRAPING` for PDF justification

## Imports

Shared code from `../popup/src/lib/` (storage, ai, prompts, license). Keep imports relative; no bundler for SW.

## Lifecycle

MV3 SW sleeps after ~30s — persist state in `chrome.storage`, not module-level variables.
